	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Pro libellis nuper ad me missis, qui quam placuerunt non solum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mihi sed et aliis, documento est, quod eosdem amicis commodatos nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>recuperare potui, summam habeo gratiam ac iam literis respondissem, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nisi tabellionum defectus impedivisset.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgum</placeName> obsidio<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ne verius liberatum est quam deditione aut redemptione in <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>pristinam gratiam receptum; nam expugnationis difficultas, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>stipendii defectus, negotiorum et bellorum moles aliunde motorum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ingruens ac constans virtus et fortitudo <placeName>Partenopolitanorum</placeName> pacem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>eis pepererunt, et ut audimus, nondum omnia apud <placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tranquilla sunt; miles enim, tum qui extra tum qui intra urbem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuit, militare volens novo stipendio a duce <placeName ref="l701">Mechenlburgensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><persName>Georgio</persName>, qui toto obsidionis tempore fere captus in urbe fuit, obęratur, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>verum in quem usum, nondum nobis certo constat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName>Henricus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Brunswicensis</persName> dux contra quoque in armis est.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quidam dicunt <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName>Danie</placeName> regis fratrem electum episcopum diocesium <placeName ref="l61">Bremen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et <placeName ref="l1875">Hildeshem</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1041">Brunswicensem</placeName> autem bonam <placeName ref="l1875">Hildeshemensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>episcopatus partem armis iam olim occupatum tenere, quam nuper <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>designatus episcopus recuperare moliatur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Alii suspicantur non satis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>convenire <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> cum rege <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName>; <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName> enim <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>expetere dicunt a <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> eas urbes, in quibus ęrarię fodinę sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tanquam ad coronam <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemię</placeName> pertinentes, quarum redditionem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>alter omnino detrectat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Catzenelnbogensis</placeName> quoque comitatus <placeName>Naso<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>vio</placeName> adiudicati per delegatos <persName ref="p18538">Cesaris</persName> nuper in fidem a <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nomine liberorum lantgravii et sacramentis fidelitatis susceptio <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>aut insignis temeritatis aut novę confęderationis indicium est.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Hec hyems bellicis parturitionibus gravida forsan ad ęstatem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>futuram facem et ferrum enitetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Concilii actiones compertiores vobis esse suspicor quam nobis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>suorum theologorum missionem causando extrahere videntur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><persName>Mauritius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>item dux <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergensis</placeName> instant, ut concilium a novo reassum[atur] <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nec preiuditia a paucis <placeName>Romanensibus</placeName> nostris non per contumaciam ab[<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>sen]tibus cause et doctrine nostre fraudi sint, quod Cercopum cetus nullo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>modo faciet.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed ex actionibus bellicis modo aperte constat exiguam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>concilii modo rationem esse.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quid nos de bellicis tumultibus audiamus, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in adiecta schedula videre poteris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Ex <placeName ref="l830">Aglia</placeName> scribuntur a bonis viris talia contra <placeName ref="l2671">Sommersett<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>i</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ducem, quę ego in tanti viri animum nunquam descendere potuisse credid[erim]; <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>si vera sunt, eius me miseret, et humanę inconstantie et fragilitatis <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>lugenda indicia sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed quęstionis exitus hęc edocebit; spero meliora.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Serenissimus rex cum universo regno alias prospere et tranquille <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>agit; quem deus nobis conservet.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quid apud vos agatur, scire <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>cupio.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Responsionis tarditatem tabellionum defectui et hyemis <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>incommoditati imputes.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commenda me tuis generis, <persName ref="p8171">Bibli<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>andro</persName> et aliis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l491">Argentine</placeName> 20. decembris anno 1551.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Commenda me d. <persName ref="p1419">Habęo</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>In arundineto <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> sedent patres<note type="margin">a. R. übergeschr.: p[astores</note> qui pro eorum beneplacito <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>et aurium suarum deliciis et suavitate fistulas concinnant et coniungunt; <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>sed quandoquidem superos in certamen musicum devocare ausi <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>sunt, excitavit deus tibicines et buccinatores horrisonos, qui <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>cum eis certent.]</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p8121">C[hristophoru<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>s] M[ontius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite der Beilage aufgeklebt / S. 898:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Pietate et s<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>cientia claro d. <persName ref="p495">Bull<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>ingero</persName>, amico obser<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>vandissimo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürg</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="attachment">[Beilage, a. R.: scheint ausser d. Überschr. nicht v. <persName ref="p8121">Mont</persName> geschr. zu sein:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Conditiones pacis <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgen[sium]</placeName> heę esse perhibent<lb xml:id="p3z7"/>ur: <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>Ut civitas numeret imperatori 50 milia certis et statutis temporibus, donec <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>tota summa compleatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z11"/>Eidem dent bombardas sex.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z12"/>Restituant capitularibus arces aliquandiu occupatas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z13"/>Coram electore et <persName ref="p3730">Schwendio</persName> deprecentur flexis poplitibus culpam, <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>si quam perpetraverunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z15"/>Princeps noster hoc ex peracto bello habebit premii atque commodi, quod <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>eum <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> recepturi sunt in burgravium, cuius pręsidio <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>et tutela in posterum tuto fruantur; firma itaque et aeterna pax facta est <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>inter domum <placeName ref="l749">Saxonicam</placeName> et inter civitatem utrique partis utilis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z19"/>Capitulares vero si quid iuris hactenus in eam habuerunt, id totum <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>nunc illis ereptum est et ad nostros translatum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z21"/>Ad proximam septimanam elector cogitabit, quot civitates et arces in <lb xml:id="p3z22"/>episcopatu eligat in recompensationem sumptuum expositorum, qui in aliquot <lb xml:id="p3z23"/>centena milia assurgunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Sacrificuli viri bellicosi omnibus iam fiunt <lb xml:id="p3z24"/>ludibrio et conciliato in se cunctorum odio prę animorum tristitia <lb xml:id="p3z25"/>contab<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>esc<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>un<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>t.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
